  "description": "Installation of an internally illuminated advert within a digital communications unit.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed Communication Hub, by reason of its scale, siting and appearance would result in an obtrusive and visually incongruous feature that contributes to an unsightly proliferation and clutter of signage and street furniture in the local area that would detract from the design, character and appearance of the Kingsland Conservation area. As such, the proposal would be contrary to policies D4 (Delivering Good Design),&amp;nbsp; D8 (Public Realm) and HC1 (Heritage conservation and growth) of the London Plan (2021) and policies PP1 (Public Realm) and LP1 (High Quality Design), LP3 (Designated Heritage Assets) of Hackney&#x27;s Local Development Plan (2020).&lt;/p&gt;"
